<section id="A5.SS2.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Ablations on Key Hyperparameters <math id="A5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ω</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega</annotation></semantics></math>.</h4>

<div id="A5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the complete results for ablations on <math id="A5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> in <a href="#A5.T8" title="In Ablations on Key Hyperparameters 𝛽 and 𝜔. ‣ E.2 Additional Ablation Results ‣ Appendix E Additional Results ‣ SPG: Sandwiched Policy Gradient for Masked Diffusion Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> and for ablations on <math id="A5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ω</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega</annotation></semantics></math> in <a href="#A5.T9" title="In Ablations on Key Hyperparameters 𝛽 and 𝜔. ‣ E.2 Additional Ablation Results ‣ Appendix E Additional Results ‣ SPG: Sandwiched Policy Gradient for Masked Diffusion Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>.</p>
</div>
